        "created_at": "2017-06-08T01:23:28.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, I was thinking that the other day. My offline life and online life elsewhere has been... not good at all, so it's really helpful to kick back in a fandom where the creators are friendly and welcoming, the livestreams are full of fun and humor, and the fans don't make fun of each other's favorite things or put each other down.</p>",
